  "prefLabel": "Cul-H 104 CREATION AND ORGANIZATION OF ADVISORY COUNCILS",
  "recordType": "rule-part",
  "ruleText": "PART Cul-H 104 CREATION AND ORGANIZATION OF ADVISORY COUNCILS\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 227-C:5, XXI\n\n(a) Cul-H 104.01 Advisory Councils. The SHPO can create and organize advisory councils pursuant to RSA 227-C:5, XXI, RSA 227-C:3, IV, and the National Historic Preservation Act of 1966, 16 USC 470i, as amended.\n\nSource. #10217, eff 10-30-12, EXPIRED: 7-1-18\n\nAppendix",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/cul-h100.html"
